APACHE LICENSE 2.0  (see LICENSE-APACHE)  — the engine and the standard,
meant to be adopted, embedded and forked freely, with an explicit patent grant:

    backend/pricing/        curve bootstrap, pricing, risk, XVA, SIMM, SA-CCR
